1st Sub. S.B. 187
Renter Credit Reporting Amendments
Senate Amendments Amendment 1 February 25, 2026 09:12 AM
Senator Wayne A. Harper proposes the following amendments:
1. Line 38 through 44:
38 (i) created:
39 (A) in accordance with Section 53A-8-402; and
40 (B) by a city of the first class; and
41 (ii) that enters into a rental agreement with a renter for a rental unit that is owned by the
housing authority.
42 (c) "Nationwide consumer reporting agency" means the same as the term "consumer
43 reporting agency that compiles and maintains files on consumers on a nationwide
44 basis" is defined in 15 U.S.C. Sec. 1681a(p).
